    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "zh-CN",
      "values": {
        "zh-CN": "含重复向量的向量族",
        "en": "A Family with a Repeated Vector"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "thm-hyp(__list__(__list__(\n  LA.VectorSpace(V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace, $\\mathbb{K}$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace),\n  Type.annotation(@n@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, Nat),\n  Type.annotation(@$\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, Type.to(LA.Fin(n@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily), V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace))\n), LA.HasRepeat($\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, n@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily)), LA.LinearlyDependent($\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "任何含两个相同向量出现的有限向量族都线性相关：对应系数取 $1$ 与 $-1$。",
          "en": "Every finite family with two equal occurrences is dependent: use coefficients $1$ and $-1$ at those positions."
        }
      }
    },
